      "name": "The Flat Rate Movers — Industrial & Commercial Project Support Operations Dataset",
      "description": "Industrial & commercial project support operations from The Flat Rate Movers: trained, supervised moving and warehouse teams supporting contractors, project managers and operations buyers — a B2B project-support service, not a listing of individual labor. Four service lines (published): Warehouse & Distribution; Commercial Relocation & Logistics, including white-glove and blanket-wrap handling; FF&E Installation & Project Support; and Flexible Workforce Deployment. Support types (published): military and regular household-goods loading and unloading; APU and driver crew support; warehouse load-outs and inbound unloads, including trailer loading and offloading and warehouse organization; vault and container handling with inventory, sorting, labeling and pallet work; residential driver-meet jobs; rush, overflow and short-notice support; and ocean container, PODS, transloading, restacking and packing support through the company's warehouse and transload operation. Published workflow: send the job details; confirm team, scope and rate; the team is dispatched; invoice per job. Teams are self-managed and supervised, trained in-house, with team size matched to each job; pricing is per job with no required contract duration.",
